---
import Card from "./Card.astro";
import Label from "./Label.astro";
---

<section id="how" class="border-b border-neutral-950 py-20 sm:py-28">
	<Label>04 / Supported managers</Label>
	<h2
		class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"
	>
		Covers the stack you actually run.
	</h2>
	<div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
		<Card kicker="npm" title="package.json">
			<p>
				Dependencies and devDependencies resolved through the
				<code class="font-mono">npm</code>
				Datasource, with plain semver versioning.
			</p>
		</Card>
		<Card kicker="mise" title="mise.toml">
			<p>
				One Manager across every backend —
				<code class="font-mono">core:node</code>,
				<code class="font-mono">aqua:aws/aws-cli</code>,
				<code class="font-mono">github:endevco/aube</code>,
				<code class="font-mono">npm:@openai/codex</code>
				— each routed to the right Datasource.
			</p>
		</Card>
		<Card kicker="github-actions" title="workflow files">
			<p>
				Actions resolved via <code class="font-mono">github-tags</code>,
				tolerant of a leading <code class="font-mono">v</code> — and pinned to
				their sha by default.
			</p>
		</Card>
	</div>
</section>
